     "when": "Available after collecting the \"The Hole in the Desert\" Multi Moon.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Sand_Kingdom_Power_Moon_37_-_You%27re_Quite_a_Catch,_Captain_Toad!#sand-kingdom-power-moon-37-youre-quite-a-catch-captain-toad",
