     "when": "Available after collecting the \"The Hole in the Desert\" Multi Moon.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Sand_Kingdom_Power_Moon_38_-_Jaxi_Reunion!#sand-kingdom-power-moon-38-jaxi-reunion",
