     "name": "Wandering Cactus",
     "multi": false,
     "how": "To the north of the Desert Oasis, the player can find a cactus with some birds on it. If the player captures the cactus, they can move it out of the way to reveal a glowing spot on the sand. Mario must then ground pound the glowing spot to reveal a Power Moon.",
     "when": "Available from the start.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Sand_Kingdom_Power_Moon_40_-_Wandering_Cactus#sand-kingdom-power-moon-40-wandering-cactus",
