     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Sand_Kingdom_Power_Moon_57_-_The_Bullet_Bill_Maze:_Side_Path#sand-kingdom-power-moon-57-the-bullet-bill-maze-side-path",
