     "multi": false,
     "how": "In the Tostarena Town, the player can find a Mini Rocket on top of a building on the right side. Mario should capture the rocket to be taken to a secret area, where he must cross several rotating buildings without the help of Cappy. If the player can make it to the end of this secret area, they will receive a Power Moon.",
     "when": "Available after collecting the \"The Hole in the Desert\" Multi Moon.",
