     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Sand_Kingdom_Power_Moon_65_-_Hat_and_Seek:_In_the_Sand#sand-kingdom-power-moon-65-hat-and-seek-in-the-sand",
