     "multi": false,
     "how": "This moon lies in the downward sand flow in the west area of Tostarena Ruins. Mario will slip down if he attempts to climb the sand flow, so he must fall from the moving lifts directly above the sand flow to obtain this moon.",
     "when": "Available after opening the kingdom's Moon Rock.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Sand_Kingdom_Power_Moon_72_-_Into_the_Flowing_Sands#sand-kingdom-power-moon-72-into-the-flowing-sands",
