     "name": "Flooding Pipeway",
     "multi": false,
     "how": "Near the Iron Road: Entrance, the player can find a pool of water with a submerged Warp Pipe. Mario should enter this Warp Pipe and then reach the end of the secret area within in order to receive a Power Moon.",
     "when": "Available from the start.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Wooded_Kingdom_Power_Moon_39_-_Flooding_Pipeway#wooded-kingdom-power-moon-39-flooding-pipeway",
