     "when": "Intended to be available after collecting the \"Flower Thieves of Sky Garden\" Multi Moon, but can be obtained from the start using skilled jumps.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Wooded_Kingdom_Power_Moon_44_-_Flower_Road_Reach#wooded-kingdom-power-moon-44-flower-road-reach",
