     "when": "Available after opening the kingdom's Moon Rock.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Wooded_Kingdom_Power_Moon_73_-_Herding_Sheep_Above_the_Forest_Fog#wooded-kingdom-power-moon-73-herding-sheep-above-the-forest-fog",
