     "when": "Available after opening the kingdom's Moon Rock.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Wooded_Kingdom_Power_Moon_74_-_Herding_Sheep_on_the_Iron_Bridge#wooded-kingdom-power-moon-74-herding-sheep-on-the-iron-bridge",
