     "when": "Available after opening the kingdom's Moon Rock.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Wooded_Kingdom_Power_Moon_76_-_Below_Breakdown_Road#wooded-kingdom-power-moon-76-below-breakdown-road",
