     "when": "Available from the start.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Lost_Kingdom_Power_Moon_15_-_Moon_Shards_in_the_Jungle#lost-kingdom-power-moon-15-moon-shards-in-the-jungle",
