     "when": "Available from the start.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Lost_Kingdom_Power_Moon_16_-_Peeking_Out_from_Under_the_Bridge#lost-kingdom-power-moon-16-peeking-out-from-under-the-bridge",
