     "when": "Available from the start.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Lost_Kingdom_Power_Moon_20_-_Get_Some_Rest,_Captain_Toad#lost-kingdom-power-moon-20-get-some-rest-captain-toad",
