     "when": "Available after opening the kingdom's Moon Rock.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Lost_Kingdom_Power_Moon_34_-_Chasing_Klepto#lost-kingdom-power-moon-34-chasing-klepto",
