     "when": "Available from the start.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Snow_Kingdom_Power_Moon_29_-_Moon_Shards_in_the_Cold_Room#snow-kingdom-power-moon-29-moon-shards-in-the-cold-room",
