     "when": "Available after collecting \"The Bound Bowl Grand Prix\" Multi Moon.",
     "ign": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/super-mario-odyssey/Snow_Kingdom_Power_Moon_31_-_Spinning_Above_the_Clouds#snow-kingdom-power-moon-31-spinning-above-the-clouds",
